Z||000009||rx7speed||10-11-2001||01:41 PM||||ok I just read what Iwas saying and damn wtf.<BR>I was half asleep at the time I guess<P>but no it is not carb but an 87 with FI. <BR>the choke I was refering to is in the secondary thorttle plates they have to sets of them. they act as a choke and open up when the car is cold.<P>as for tires yeah I am looking at getting the BF g-force. flywheel is the stock one. think it wieghs in at 24lbs or so. stock clutch but have not had need for a different one yet. stock ignition also.<BR>have an intake and TB though that is sitting around waiting to be ported.just about to purchase a new catback also as well as new ignition.<P>do your fieros have IRS. <P>though I am almost ready to just sepnd the 1200 and get a turbo motor.<P>------------------<BR>who needs pistons I have rotary<P><p>[This message has been edited by rx7speed (edited 10-11-2001).]||||reg||1
